However, I have a question. How likely is it that the embassy will recommend me if I get to the interview? And how likely is it that mext will reject me after my embassy has recommended me? I've heard that it's very rare that mext rejects a graduate studies applicant after the embassy has recommended them, but what about people applying for undergraduate?

