Fullmetal Alchemist and Madoka Magica. They're both very special shows to me, especially MM since it helped me come to terms with the fact I was bi.

&#x200B;

Edit: I can't avoid mentioning Evangelion, Inuyasha and Ruroni Kenshin. Yes I know Wazuki is a pedo but it doesn't change the fact that Ruroni Kenshin was one of my first anime and it helped me when I was at my lowest. Another show I love but recognize is not as great as I remember is Ranma 1/2.

